        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "This is the place you want to take your vehicle!!!! And trust me ask for Zack He’s an outstanding mechanic who truly cares about his customers. From the moment I walked in, his knowledge and passion for his work were evident. He explained my car’s issues clearly and offered honest recommendations without upselling.\n\nZack went above and beyond to ensure my car was in top shape before handing it back to me. His attention to detail and commitment to quality are impressive. If you need a reliable mechanic, look no further—Zack is your guy!",
        "time": 1728949795,
        "translated": false
